  "status_text": "Seven gates are out for the triangle's three jobs. Lean checked that with at most one NOT, a circuit of seven gates or fewer cannot both tell whether at least two of A, B and C are on and, when they are, report whether exactly one end of AB is on and whether exactly one end of BC is on. Each AND, OR or NOT gate reads at most two earlier wires, and constants are free. The next test is whether eight can do all three (L-meta-42704).",
